      "description": "Knight Rider is one of the most iconic TV series that took place during the 80s, where we follow Michael Long that recovers from a fatal wound, and he assumes a new identity waging war against criminals.\n\nThe star of the Knight Rider show is definitely the KITT car, which is an extremely impressive, unique vehicle with futuristic features.\n\nImmerse yourself into the world of KITT!\nAs soon as you start the Knight Rider KITT app, nostalgia kicks in right away. If you were a fan of the original series or reboot, you will find yourself impressed and excited to connect with the car at such a personal level.\n\nIt’s fun and engaging, interesting and enjoyable. Plus, you get to try out something new and it’s one of those things that can make a huge difference.\n\nThe Knight Rider KITT experience is very engaging, immersive and it’s a must-have for anyone that loves the Knight Rider experience. Not only is it very interesting and enjoyable, but you will find it to be a great way to replicate those amazing moments you had while seeing the show many years ago. Grab the Knight Rider app right now and start talking with KITT in no time!\n\nFREE VERSION\n\n1. Check the Auto Cruise, Normal Cruise and Pursuit modes.\n2. Check the KITT switchpods, lower console (Activate different functions)\n\nGO PREMIUM\n\n1. Talk to KITT (Ask anything)\n2. KITT is now multilingual (German, Italian, Spanish, French...etc)\n3. Ask KITT to call April, call Bonnie, call Devon...etc\n4. Check the Auto Cruise, Normal Cruise and Pursuit modes.\n5. Check the KITT switchpods (Activate different functions)\n6. Check the KITT lower console (Activate different functions)\n7. Ask KITT to call April, call Bonnie, call Devon\n\nWatch KITT - Systems Activated in Action:\n\n1. https://www.youtube.com/shorts/6qyLGfpJBxE\n2. https://www.youtube.com/shorts/fvIdVoRB1M0\n3. https://youtu.be/4vdBneiPIoQ\n4. https://youtu.be/WePIIOEInY8\n\nEnjoy the Knight Rider experience!   \n\nPrivacy policy : https://kittparts.com/privacy-policy \nTerm of use : https://kittparts.com/terms-and-conditions",
